    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 630 of the laws of 1988, amending the insurance law relating to establishing an excess line advisory organization, in relation to the effective date thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S3857",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3857-2013",
